  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the Monster Manual's Ooze Cube (Gelatinous Cube): creatures move through each other's spaces (the Passable status, one of dnd5e's statuses that never block movement); a creature that enters its space by its own move is subjected to its Engulf, with Disadvantage on the save (if it fits the room left inside); its Engulf overlay asks, for each creature whose space the cube's move enters, whether it engulfs it, and lets a creature within 5 feet pull an engulfed creature out. Its Pull Check and Puller Damage are used by that, not on their own.</p>",
      "chatFlavor": ""
    },
    "identifier": "ooze-cube-overlay",
    "source": {
      "rules": "2024"
    },
